# Build output: always rebuilt inside the image, and a stale obj/ would poison the restore layer.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/TestResults/

# Editor, VCS and local-only files
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/.git/
.gitignore
**/*.user
**/*.suo

# Secrets and local environment: never bake these into an image layer.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/secrets.json

# Not needed to build the services
**/node_modules/
**/Dockerfile*
**/.dockerignore
*.md
